[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0061","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1714","title":"Joomla 组件 Arcade Games 1.0 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! Arcade Games 组件 1.0 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入目录遍历序列（../）读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 使用 com_arcadegames 1.0 组件的站点，远程未授权攻击者可直接通过构造恶意 controller 参数实现任意文件读取，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），属于 CWE-22 路径遍历类漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可利用 controller 参数中的目录遍历序列读取服务器敏感文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1714"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-05-04T16:00:36Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:10Z","remediation":"建议将 Arcade Games (com_arcadegames) 组件升级至官方修复目录遍历问题的版本；若该组件已停止维护，应在 Joomla 后台扩展管理中直接卸载或禁用该组件。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层部署过滤规则，拦截 index.php 的 controller 参数中包含 ../ 或 .. 的请求，或使用 ModSecurity 等 WAF 规则阻止路径穿越字符，并限制 Web 目录文件读取权限以减小信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlaarcadegames-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/39413","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12168","http://www.osvdb.org/63660","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0860","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57683","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12168","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1714.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0061.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0063","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1717","title":"Joomla! iF surfALERT 组件 1.2 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 iF surfALERT 组件 1.2 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 controller 参数传递包含 .. 的路径实现目录穿越，读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1717"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb","nuclei"],"published":"2010-05-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"移除或禁用 iF surfALERT 组件 1.2 版本，该组件已停止维护，建议卸载此组件或使用替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T13:08:02Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/39526","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12291","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0924"],"poc_urls":["http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12291"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0060","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1659","title":"Joomla! Ultimate Portfolio 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! CMS 旗下 Ultimate Portfolio 1.0 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 index.php 发起请求时在控制器参数中嵌入 '..' 路径穿越序列，绕过验证访问服务器上任意文件。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 用户，导致敏感信息泄露。漏洞因可读取文件而具备安全风险，CVSS 评分 5.0，等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1659"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-05-03T13:51:53Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:48Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 Joomla! Ultimate Portfolio 组件（com_ultimateportfolio）1.0 版本，该组件已停止维护无官方补丁。若必须保留，请在 index.php 中对 controller 参数实施严格白名单校验，仅允许字母数字下划线，拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\ 的请求。同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置规则阻断路径遍历载荷，并限制 PHP open_basedir 目录防止跨目录读取敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlaultimateportfolio-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12426","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39739","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/58177","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12426","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1659.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-1659.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1659.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scrip