，危害等级中危。受影响的版本包括 JBoss EAP 4.2.0 系列及 4.3.0 系列，建议升级至 CP09/CP08 及以上版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1429"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-28T22:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:22Z","remediation":"升级 JBoss EAP 至 4.2.0.CP09 或 4.3.0.CP08 及以上版本（对应 RHSA-2010:0376/RHSA-2010:0377）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 /status 及 /JMX 端点的外部访问，仅允许可信任管理 IP 访问；同时禁用 status servlet 的 full=true 参数查询功能，或直接移除部署中的 status-invoker.sar 组件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=132698550418872&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/39563","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023918","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39710","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0992","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=585900","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/58149","https://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2010-0376.html","https://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2010-0377.html","https://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2010-0378.html","https://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2010-0379.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44009/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1429.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1429.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1429.yaml","https://github.com/CCrashBandicot/helpful/blob/336b2c95b482d6c9de7756109b2699c7cfd8545c/CVE-2010-1429.txt","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-1429.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/35622681f0b1b2e88f53f70590ed8e8540eebf1f/references/CVE-2010-1429-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/faaab442a02d3e0621b98b9cb588f9f3801b024d/2010/CVE-2010-1429.json","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/2375659_CVE-2010-1429_JBoss_Insecure_Storage_of_Sensitive_Information_on_ipsmtncoug.md","https://github.com/method-security/webscan/blob/ddfe93858ef377a10027023c31d31aa08d46bfda/utils/nuclei/templates/pentest/scan/cve/2010/CVE-2010-1429.yaml","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/29751.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0031.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0052","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1586","title":"惠普系统管理主页 - 'RedirectUrl' 参数 URL 重定向漏洞","description":"惠普系统管理主页（System Management Homepage）是一款为服务器管理的IT管理员提供的综合工具，可预测、诊断和快速响应潜在或实际的系统故障。攻击者可通过SMH的可信URL漏洞利用RedirectUrl参数劫持受害者跳转到任意恶意网站，进而利用浏览器漏洞进一步攻击受害者操作系统并实现远程代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1586"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb","hp","nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到惠普系统管理主页v6.2或更高版本以修复漏洞，建议安装供应商发布的最新补丁和安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T11:00:54Z","references":["http://yehg.net/lab/pr0js/advisories/hp_system_management_homepage_url_redirection_abuse","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39676","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/58107","http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c02518794&lang=en&cc=us&taskId=101&prodSeriesId=344313&prodTypeId=18964","http://yehg.net/lab/pr0js/advisories/hp_system_management_homepage_url_redirection_abuse"],"poc_urls":["http://x.x.x.x:2301/red2301.html?RedirectUrl=evil@attacker.com"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0050","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1535","title":"Joomla! TRAVELbook 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 TRAVELbook（com_travelbook）组件 1.0.1 版本存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞，其根源在于组件在处理 index.php 的 controller 参数时未对用户输入进行充分的路径过滤与校验。远程、无需身份认证的攻击者可通过向 index.php 提交包含“../”（点点）序列的恶意 controller 参数，突破目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源代码、敏感凭证等）。该漏洞影响安装并启用了 TRAVELbook 1.0.1 组件的 Joomla! 网站，攻击仅需构造特制 URL 发起 HTTP 请求即可，可造成敏感信息泄露，并可能被进一步利用产生其他未明影响。建议用户及时升级或停用存在漏洞的组件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1535"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-04-26T18:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Joomla! TRAVELbook 组件至 1.0.2 或更高版本，官方已修复该目录遍历漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Joomla 后台禁用 com_travelbook 组件，或在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含 \"../\" 等目录遍历序列的 controller 参数请求。同时建议将 PHP 配置中 open_basedir 限制在网站根目录，限制 PHP 文件读取范围作为纵深防御。建议定期检查 Joomla 官方安全公告及时更新所有扩展组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/39254","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12151","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12151","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1535.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2010/CVE-2010-1535.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1535.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bef45ac8bcc9ee2ca44f6ae8c25801f320761c2b/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1535.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-1535-1725.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-1535-1724.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2010-1535.yaml","ht